NAME
    gcloud beta redis acl-policies - manage ACL policies of Memorystore for
        Redis Cluster instances

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud beta redis acl-policies COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (BETA) Manage ACL policies of Memorystore for Redis Cluster instances.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     create
        (BETA) Create a Redis ACL Policy.

     delete
        (BETA) Delete a Redis ACL Policy.

     describe
        (BETA) Show metadata for a Memorystore for Redis Cluster ACL policy.

     list
        (BETA) List Redis ACL Policies.

     update
        (BETA) Update aclPolicies.

NOTES
    This command is currently in beta and might change without notice. These
    variants are also available:

        $ gcloud redis acl-policies

        $ gcloud alpha redis acl-policies

